
>> a := Lista ← (Lista ← 100 ; 200 ; 300) ; (Lista ← 9 ; 8 ; 7).
Ħruġ ikteb: ['at 0,1 :'].
Ħruġ ikteb: a ? 0 ? 1, linja-ġdida. 
Ħruġ ikteb: ['at 1,2 :'].
Ħruġ ikteb: a ? 1 ? 2, linja-ġdida. 
>> menu := Dizzjunarju ġdid.
menu poġġi: (Lista ← ['pizza'] ; ['spaghetti']) fi: ['Italian Cuisine'].
menu poġġi: (Lista ← ['bifteki'] ; ['suflaki']) fi: ['Greek Cuisine'].
Ħruġ ikteb: ['I love '] + (menu ? ['Greek Cuisine'] ? 0) + [' and '] + (menu ? ['Italian Cuisine'] ? 1), linja-ġdida. 
Ħruġ ikteb: ['but not on the same plate.'], linja-ġdida.
